{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["Copper Ore is obtained from ",["l","采矿#Copper Node","Copper Nodes"]," with a ",["l","十字镐","pickaxe"],". Mining a copper node will yield between 1 and 3 copper ore. The ",["l","技能#Mining","Miner Profession"]," can further increase this."]]]],["Locations",2,[["l",0,[[1,["Can be bought at the ",["l","铁匠铺","Blacksmith"]," for 75g each in Year 1 and for 150g each in Year 2+"]],[1,["Mining ",["l","采矿#Copper Node","Copper Nodes"],"."]],[2,[["l","矿井","The Mines"]," (Floors 2-39) have a high concentration of ",["l","采矿#Copper Node","Copper Nodes"],", relative to other floors. The surrounding regular rocks also have a high probability of dropping a single copper ore."]],[2,["Copper Nodes can spawn in the ",["l","采石场","Quarry"],", the ",["l","采石场矿井","Quarry Mine"],", or in the quarry on the ",["l","农场地图#Hilltop","Hill-top"]," and ",["l","农场地图#Four Corners","Four Corners"]," Farm Maps."]],[2,["Copper Nodes can be found on any floor of the ",["l","骷髅洞穴","Skull Cavern"]," and ",["l","火山地牢","Volcano Dungeon"],"."]],[1,["Can be found in breakable crates and barrels in ",["l","矿井","the Mines"],"."]],[1,["Can be found by ",["l","锄头","tilling"]," soil in ",["l","矿井","the Mines"],"."]],[1,["Can be dropped by ",["l","金属大头","Metal Head"],"s on floors 80-119 of ",["l","矿井","the Mines"],"."]],[1,["Can be dropped by ",["l","史莱姆","Copper Slimes"]," in the ",["l","采石场矿井","Quarry Mine"]," or random ",["l","矿井#Dungeon Floors","dungeon floors"]," in the Mines."]],[1,["Can be found inside any of the 4 types of ",["l","矿物#Geodes","Geode"],"."]],[1,["Can be found in ",["l","钓鱼#Treasure Chests","Fishing Treasure Chests"],"."]],[1,["Can be found in the ",["l","垃圾桶","Garbage Can"]," outside the ",["l","铁匠铺","Blacksmith"],"."]],[1,["Can be found by ",["l","淘盘","panning"],"."]],[1,["Can be found by digging up an ",["l","远古斑点","Artifact Spot"]," (at ",["l","鹈鹕镇","Pelican Town"],", ",["l","铁路","Railroad"],", ",["l","巴士站","Bus Stop"],", ",["l","边远森林","Backwoods"],", ",["l","煤矿森林","Cindersap Forest"],", or ",["l","深山","the Mountain"],"s)"]],[1,["Occasionally sold by the ",["l","旅行货车","Traveling Cart"]," for 100–1,000g."]],[1,["A ",["l","石鱼","Stonefish"]," ",["l","鱼塘","Fish Pond"]," may produce 5 Copper Ore when the population reaches 3."]],[1,["Can be purchased from ",["l","克林特","Clint"],"'s ",["l","沙漠节#Villager Shops","shop"]," at the ",["l","沙漠节","Desert Festival"]," for 2 Calico Eggs ",["l","卡利科三花蛋","Calico Egg"],"s each."]]]]]],["Smelting",2,[["p",["Copper ore can be smelted in a ",["l","熔炉","Furnace"]," to create a ",["l","铜锭","Copper Bar"],". The smelting requires 5 copper ore and 1 ",["l","煤炭","coal"]," to begin and takes 30 in-game minutes to complete."]]]],["Crafting",2,[["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Image"]},{"h":1,"v":["Name"]},{"h":1,"v":["Description"]},{"h":1,"v":["Ingredients"]},{"h":1,"v":["Recipe Source"]}],[[["f","Cherry_Bomb.png",48]],[["l","樱桃炸弹","Cherry Bomb"]],["Generates a small explosion. Stand back!"],[["i","(O)378","Copper Ore ×4"],["i","(O)382","Coal ×1"]],[["f","Mining_Skill_Icon.png",24]," ",["l","采矿","Mining"]," Level 1"]],[[["f","Furnace.png",48]],[["l","熔炉","Furnace"]],["Turns ore and coal into metal bars."],[["i","(O)378","Copper Ore ×20"],["i","(O)390","Stone ×25"]],[["f","Clint_Icon.png",32]," ",["l","克林特","Clint"]," after collecting 1+ Copper Ore."]],[[["f","Flute_Block.png",48]],[["l","长笛块","Flute Block"]],["Plays a flute sound when you walk past."],[["i","(O)388","Wood ×10"],["i","(O)378","Copper Ore ×2"],["i","(O)771","Fiber ×20"]],[["f","Robin_Icon.png",32]," ",["l","罗宾","Robin"]," 6-heart event"]],[[["f","Drum_Block.png",48]],[["l","鼓块","Drum Block"]],["Plays a drum sound when you walk past."],[["i","(O)390","Stone ×10"],["i","(O)378","Copper Ore ×2"],["i","(O)771","Fiber ×20"]],[["f","Robin_Icon.png",32]," ",["l","罗宾","Robin"]," 6-heart event"]]]]]],["Gifting",2,[["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Hate"]},[["l","罗宾","Robin"],", ",["l","德米特里厄斯","Demetrius"],", ",["l","玛鲁","Maru"],", ",["l","塞巴斯蒂安","Sebastian"],", ",["l","莱纳斯","Linus"],", ",["l","雷欧","Leo"],", ",["l","皮埃尔","Pierre"],", ",["l","卡洛琳","Caroline"],", ",["l","阿比盖尔","Abigail"],", ",["l","亚历克斯","Alex"],", ",["l","乔治","George"],", ",["l","艾芙琳","Evelyn"],", ",["l","刘易斯","Lewis"],", ",["l","克林特","Clint"],", ",["l","潘妮","Penny"],", ",["l","潘姆","Pam"],", ",["l","艾米丽","Emily"],", ",["l","海莉","Haley"],", ",["l","贾斯","Jas"],", ",["l","文森特","Vincent"],", ",["l","乔迪","Jodi"],", ",["l","肯特","Kent"],", ",["l","山姆","Sam"],", ",["l","莉亚","Leah"],", ",["l","谢恩","Shane"],", ",["l","玛妮","Marnie"],", ",["l","艾利欧特","Elliott"],", ",["l","格斯","Gus"],", ",["l","矮人","Dwarf"],", ",["l","法师","Wizard"],", ",["l","哈维","Harvey"],", ",["l","桑迪","Sandy"],", ",["l","威利","Willy"],", ",["l","科罗布斯","Krobus"]]]]]]],["Tailoring",2,[["p",["Copper Ore can be used in the spool of the ",["l","柳巷2号#Sewing Machine","Sewing Machine"]," to create the dyeable ",["l","裁缝","Turtleneck Sweater"],". ",["f","Shirt178.png",24]," It can be used in ",["l","染色","dyeing"],", serving as an orange dye at the dye pots, located in ",["l","艾米丽","Emily"],"'s and ",["l","海莉","Haley"],"'s house, ",["l","柳巷2号","2 Willow Lane"],"."]]]],["Quests",2,[["l",0,[[1,["The morning after collecting 1 Copper Ore, ",["l","克林特","Clint"]," will visit you and give you the blueprints for crafting a ",["l","熔炉","Furnace"],". This creates the ",["l","任务#Forging Ahead","\"Forging Ahead\" quest"],"."]],[1,[["l","克林特","Clint"]," may ask you to collect various numbers of Copper Ore in random ",["l","任务#Help Wanted Quests","Gathering Quests"]," at the \"Help Wanted\" board outside ",["l","皮埃尔的杂货店","Pierre's General Store"],"."]],[1,["10 Copper Ore are requested by ",["l","石鱼","Stonefish"]," in a ",["l","鱼塘#Quests","Fish Pond quest"]," to increase the capacity of the pond from 1 to 3."]]]]]],["History",2,[["l",0,[[1,[["l","版本历史#1.3.27","1.3.27"],": Purchase price at the ",["l","铁匠铺","Blacksmith"]," increases in Year 2+ from 75g to 150g."]],[1,[["l","版本历史#1.4","1.4"],": Can now be used in ",["l","裁缝","Tailoring"],". Can